  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Trim green tops from Dutch carrots and scrub carrots clean. To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Place carrots on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until golden and tender, 20-25 minutes. Remove from the oven, drizzle over the honey and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cdab18645a16b947c5493-ab64340b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, add the water and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside, until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cdab18645a16b947c5493-3d969358.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the couscous is cooking, thinly red slice radish.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cdab18645a16b947c5493-a9aa13ad.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a small heatproof bowl, add the garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts, until fragrant.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt and fetta cubes to garlic oil mixture and mash. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cdab18645a16b947c5493-7b273d34.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine pearl couscous, radish, spinach & rocket mix, golden goddess dressing and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cdab18645a16b947c5493-dce2beb7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pearl couscous salad between bowls.\n• Top with roast Dutch carrots, haloumi and fetta yoghurt.\n• Garnish with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cdab18645a16b947c5493-daa7a4b1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
